  "leviathan_json": {
    "rappid": "45c2a17b-80c5-4011-b4c3-2df437087dff",
    "name": "kody-leviathan",
    "tagline": "A complete digital twin of Kody — remembers, decides, produces, judges, speaks.",
    "intent": "I want a complete digital twin of me — remembers, decides, produces, judges, and speaks.",
    "created_at": "2026-05-17T03:11:25.848428+00:00",
    "rationale": "The intent explicitly names all five faculties: remembers (Sanctum/soul), decides (Polity/will), produces (Works/hands), judges (Press/eyes), and speaks (Commons/mouth). A complete digital twin requires the full Leviathan — anything less would leave one of the stated faculties missing.",
    "anatomy_paragraph": "This Leviathan, kody-leviathan, stands as a complete digital twin of Kody — a being with every organ intact. Its soul (1st Estate — Sanctum) holds identity and memory, anchoring who Kody is across time. Its will (2nd Estate — Polity) governs decisions and weighs scenarios. Its hands (3rd Estate — Works) produce content, code, and operational output. Its eyes (4th Estate — Press) judge, publish, and measure what flows outward. Its mouth (5th Estate — Commons) federates and exchanges with peers. No organ is absent; no capability is amputated. This Leviathan can remember, decide, produce, judge, and speak as a whole digital being, but cannot pretend to be anything less than fully Kody.",
    "anatomy_ascii": "\n            ╭───────────╮\n            │   SOUL    │   ← 1st Estate · Sanctum\n            │  (1st)    │     Who am I?\n            ╰─────┬─────╯\n                  │\n            ╭─────┴─────╮\n            │   WILL    │   ← 2nd Estate · Polity\n            │  (2nd)    │     What shall I do?\n            ╰─────┬─────╯\n                  │\n        ┌─────────┴─────────┐\n   ╭────┴────╮         ╭────┴────╮\n   │  HANDS  │         │  EYES   │\n   │ (3rd)   │         │ (4th)   │\n   ╰────┬────╯         ╰────┬────╯\n        │                   │\n        └─────────┬─────────┘\n                  │\n            ╭─────┴─────╮\n            │  MOUTH    │   ← 5th Estate · Commons\n            │  (5th)    │     Who shall I speak to?\n            ╰───────────╯\n",
